# =============================================================
# SMC SAMPLE: CatDog Dual-Frame Interleaved Bytecode
# =============================================================
# Demonstrates biological dual-frame execution (like PhiX174 overlapping genes).
# A single sequence of tokens interleaves two completely different programs!
#
# Cat Frame (Index 0, 2, 4):
#   KAMEHAMEHA "Cat: I am sophisticated and refined!"
#   THATS_ALL_FOLKS
#
# Dog Frame (Index 1, 3, 5):
#   KAMEHAMEHA "Dog: Hi-ho-diggety! Let's chase a garbage truck!"
#   THATS_ALL_FOLKS

KAMEHAMEHA KAMEHAMEHA "Cat: I am sophisticated and refined!" "Dog: Hi-ho-diggety! Let's chase a garbage truck!"
THATS_ALL_FOLKS THATS_ALL_FOLKS
